WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,170 --> 00:00:02,610
Stop putting gold on your face

2
00:00:03,050 --> 00:00:10,700
It's obviously because the child is tired and doesn't agree. If you want to say that, then I have to leave. You're going to die.

3
00:00:10,700 --> 00:00:11,700
The child is not asleep yet

4
00:00:11,700 --> 00:00:14,460
If you dare to wake him up, it will hurt you if I don’t beat him to death.

5
00:00:16,580 --> 00:00:17,660
You won't let me let go

6
00:00:18,140 --> 00:00:19,820
Does that mean you want me tonight

7
00:00:19,820 --> 00:00:23,680
Just stay in your room and pretend to have forgotten what to sleep in.

8
00:00:23,680 --> 00:00:24,840
Why are you so shameless?

9
00:00:24,840 --> 00:00:25,760
Got into my house

10
00:00:26,240 --> 00:00:27,200
Slowly explain it right

11
00:00:27,360 --> 00:00:46,580
It's really not a good thing. What do you want to do? Just do what you say.

12
00:00:47,260 --> 00:00:48,620
I helped you coax the child for so long

13
00:00:49,100 --> 00:00:50,220
You must not give me any benefit

14
00:00:50,660 --> 00:00:51,740
Talk less and speak softly

15
00:00:52,300 --> 00:00:55,060
It's obviously your own child you're coaxing, so I don't care.

16
00:00:55,700 --> 00:00:56,900
Anyway, I can't work for nothing

17
00:00:57,700 --> 00:00:58,660
You have to do me some favors

18
00:01:00,460 --> 00:01:04,610
Then hurry up and be careful not to wake up Sanya

19
00:01:05,790 --> 00:01:07,990
Xiaoyue may not be the one who has the deepest feelings for me

20
00:01:08,430 --> 00:01:09,750
But it must be the best one

21
00:01:10,270 --> 00:01:11,910
I was obviously divorced in my previous life.

22
00:01:12,270 --> 00:01:23,410
She later gave birth to a son for me. Go down and don't hinder my sleep. You asked me to hurry up and don't disturb the third girl. Okay. Stop talking and go to sleep.

23
00:01:25,950 --> 00:01:27,150
I wanted to conquer with strength

24
00:01:27,390 --> 00:01:28,470
But I don’t want to make a mistake

25
00:01:28,830 --> 00:01:34,830
Wait until I make money

26
00:01:35,190 --> 00:01:36,950
The first thing to do is to see your heart
